ent-text\"><b>Personalized Approach: <\/b>Every home is unique. We listen carefully to your goals and create tailored solutions that bring your vision to life.<\/div>    <\/div>\n  \n    <\/div>\n<div class=\"ue-step-item ue-item elementor-repeater-item-1b5e6f3\">\n    <div class=\"ue-item-highlight\">\n      \n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-icon elementor-animation-grow\">\n        <span class=\"ue-icon\"><i class='el el-idea'><\/i><\/span>                        \n              <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      \n    <\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-spacer\"><\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-content\">  \n       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-title\">Planning & Permits<\/div>       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-text\"><b>Clear Communication:<\/b> From timelines to budgets, we keep everything transparent so you always know what to expect. No surprises\u2014just results.<\/div>    <\/div>\n  \n    <\/div>\n<div class=\"ue-step-item ue-item elementor-repeater-item-406dfb2\">\n    <div class=\"ue-item-highlight\">\n      \n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-icon elementor-animation-grow\">\n        <span class=\"ue-icon\"><i class='ion ion-ios-construct'><\/i><\/span>                        \n              <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      \n    <\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-spacer\"><\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-content\">  \n       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-title\">Construction Phase<\/div>       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-text\"><b>Craftsmanship That Lasts: <\/b>Our skilled professionals use premium materials and expert techniques to ensure flawless execution that stands the test of time.<\/div>    <\/div>\n  \n    <\/div>\n<div class=\"ue-step-item ue-item elementor-repeater-item-eb608f6\">\n    <div class=\"ue-item-highlight\">\n      \n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-icon elementor-animation-grow\">\n        <span class=\"ue-icon\"><i class=' icon_house'><\/i><\/span>                        \n              <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-gap\"><\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue-step-item-line\"><\/div>\n      \n    <\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-spacer\"><\/div>\n    \n    <div class=\"ue-step-item-content\">  \n       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-title\">Final Walkthrough & Handover<\/div>       <div class=\"ue-step-item-content-text\"><b>Satisfaction Guaranteed:<\/b> We don\u2019t consider the job complete until you\u2019re 100% happy with your remodeled space\u2014down to the very last detail.<\/div>    <\/div>\n  \n    <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<!-- end Step Process -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4ff6f21\" data-id=\"4ff6f21\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec0df1f elementor-widget elementor-widget-ucaddon_image_reveal_on_scroll\" data-id=\"ec0df1f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"ucaddon_image_reveal_on_scroll.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<!-- start Scroll Image Reveal -->\n\t\t<link id='uc_ac_assets_file_uc_image_reveal_css_545-css' href='https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-content\/uploads\/ac_assets\/image_reveal_on_scroll\/uc_image_reveal.css' type='text\/css' rel='stylesheet' >\n\n<style>\/* widget: Scroll Image Reveal *\/\n\n 